WEBVTT

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.240
What a fitting position, Piglet.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.950
It suits your blistering soul.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.190
I will grant your wish.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.660
“What is an eternity?”

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.170
the boy asked the demon queen.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.600
Eternal life.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.800
Eternal love.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.540
The eternal flow of time.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.690
They all seem wonderful at first,

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.170
but are actually very cruel in reality.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:42.950
An eternity…

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.170
That is…

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.990
It has been exactly one month since the establishment of the Vampire Bund,

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.570
and we have received a message from Queen Mina.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.420
For all of the understanding and cooperation

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.880
the Japanese citizens have shown

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.840
during the establishment of the Vampire Bund,

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.280
What language is that?
during the establishment of the Vampire Bund,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.650
Ancient Sumerian.
during the establishment of the Vampire Bund,

00:00:59.650 --> 00:00:59.940
you have my deepest gratitudes.
Ancient Sumerian.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.190
Why would she…
you have my deepest gratitudes.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.720
Those subtitles are fake.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.600
This is what she’s actually saying:

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.270
“Let us settle this affair.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:10.710
Tonight, after sunset, I will be waiting at this location.”

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:11.590
Is that…

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:13.390
A challenge.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.490
To Hysterica.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:18.310
Our princess is quite bold, isn’t she?

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:28.840
This is the ampoule we found inside each of the bodies of Hysterica’s men.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:35.530
The results of the analysis revealed that this is a chemical substance synthesized from cellulose.

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:39.200
When it is mixed with vampire blood,

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.350
a strong chemical reaction occurs, resulting in combustion.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.190
So it’s the Blood of Agni.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.180
In the Middle Ages of vampires,

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.090
spies or wounded soldiers who fell into the hands of the enemy

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.000
would bite the tubes inside their mouths

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.790
and blow themselves up along with those around them.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:56.740
Yes.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:01.540
This is an improved version of the Blood of Agni, with its power increased by modern science.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.870
What’s Hysterica planning to do with this?

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:06.370
Probably suicide-bombing terrorism.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.690
They look like humans, and they don’t carry any weapons.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.630
She’s planning to plant living bombs throughout the city,

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.380
and then detonating them all at once.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.360
What is their objective?

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.010
To make the world fear vampires once more.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.810
If what Vera inferred is true and Hysterica’s new master is Telomere,

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.250
we cannot overlook this.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:30.160
But even if it has been improved,

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.340
from what we’ve seen, it still isn’t strong enough to destroy buildings.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.360
Wouldn’t that narrow down the potential targets?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.070
True enough.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:43.480
But if it were to detonate in a crowded area, the damage would be rather extreme.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.750
That is how it is.

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:48.500
It has an explosion radius of 20 meters.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.480
In an enclosed space, everyone inside would be completely annihilated.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.880
Logically, it must be the subway.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:01.980
They are almost certainly hiding underground during the day.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.950
It’s obvious that targeting the subway would pose the least risk for them,

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.270
in terms of preparation and movement.

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:09.370
How do they send out the command?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.450
With a cellphone.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:16.400
We believe Hysterica is sending the detonation signals with her cellphone.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.460
Cellphone antennas are everywhere.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:24.470
It almost seems as if she’s afraid of a place where there are no signals.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:29.840
Three thousand Beowulf troops are combing the city, searching for our enemies.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.350
I need to get going, too.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.230
Don’t worry.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:39.440
The Earth Clan was originally born to hunt down vampires.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.800
Our hearing is fifteen thousand times better than a human’s,

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.230
and our sense of smell is a hundred thousand times better.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:48.690
Sniffing them out underground is hardly difficult.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.830
Be careful, Akira-kun.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.400
Sure.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.030
In any case, how did it go for you?

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.110
What did Yuzuru’s parents say?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.840
They said, “We’ll leave him to you.”

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:06.710
They apparently don’t have time for him because stocks are fluctuating due to the Vampire Bund.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:07.790
I can’t believe it.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:08.830
Are they really parents?

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:14.500
They must be something to make you so mad.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.820
But now I get it.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.170
That’s why Yuzuru and the President were so close.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:25.350
The President was also in a complicated situation, with her parents living apart.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.980
What is the Princess planning to do with Yuzuru?

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.440
And the President, too.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.960
I don’t know.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.980
But I’m sure she has a plan.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:37.500
At the very least, she knows that she can’t leave things as they are.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.500
I’m sure of it.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.100
How is your wound?

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.650
Does it still hurt?

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.530
No, I feel fine now.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.410
Um…

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.770
May I ask you something?

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.200
What is it?

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.570
How did you become a vampire?

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:00.380
Were you attacked by a vampire like Onee-chan was?

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:09.180
I gave my blood to Her Highness’s mother, who was the previous queen, and became a vampire.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.850
I chose this way of life.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.860
Why would you choose to do that?

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.580
Becoming something like a <i>vampire</i>?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.040
I’m sorry.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:19.780
It’s fine.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.780
It is all because…

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:25.350
I loved the previous queen, Queen Lucretia, so dearly.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:28.710
I wanted to help her and be by her side forever.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.080
That’s all.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.740
Queen Lucretia has passed away,

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.440
but she has left me with Her Highness.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:39.420
Ever since then, she has been everything to me.

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:43.130
Vampires are an existence that lives within their hearts.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:47.820
Just one feeling can allow a vampire to live for an eternity.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.530
Just one feeling…

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.960
This is Team Alpha.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.410
Two located at Shinjuku Station on the Marunouchi Line.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.930
This is Team Tango.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.770
One located at the Nagatachou Station on the Hanzoumon Line.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.090
This is Team Charlie.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.440
Two located at Tokyo Station on the Marunouchi Line.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.350
This is Team Omega.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.300
Two located at the Toranomon Station on the Ginza Line.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:07.450
This is Team Zebra.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.950
One located at the Sakuradamon Station on the Yuurakuchou Line.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.730
Three located at Kasumigaseki on the Chiyoda Line.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.500
Waseda on the Touzai Line, all clear.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:17.330
Continue your search throughout the subway…

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.310
…and locate every enemy that remains.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:25.340
However, do not attack until Her Majesty prevents the detonation signal.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:27.970
Your Highness.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:32.200
We’ve picked up two objects headed towards you from Tokyo Bay.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.640
So they have come.

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.630
Thank you for coming, Miss Hysterica.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.870
Well, it was a direct invitation from Her Majesty.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:55.660
I was interested in seeing how you would welcome me, but…

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:00.190
Unfortunately, I don’t plan on sticking around with you.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.960
You’ve already figured out what I’m plotting, haven’t you?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.580
This is a great country, isn’t it?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.630
No matter where you are, you can get a good signal for your cellphone.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.010
Whether it’s underground or on top of a building.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.040
Civilization will be the human race’s downfall.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.230
Who was it that said that again?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.210
My demands are simple.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.360
Come with me on that helicopter.

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:27.030
That’s all, my dearest Princess.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:31.200
You wouldn’t dare endanger innocent citizens, would you?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.270
I see.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.910
That does sound extraordinarily simple.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.910
And it appears perfectly safe as well.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.940
But… unforeseen accidents could happen at any time.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.090
You…

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.220
Don’t you care about the humans?!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.190
Take care not to yell so much.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.410
It reveals your lowly origins.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.280
Bitch…

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.700
Look below you, Hysterica.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:00.940
Vera!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.250
Princess Mina!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:33.550
It seems you’ve greatly underestimated me!

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:37.540
Innocent people will die in Tokyo’s subways.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.550
It’ll be all your fault, Princess Mina.

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:42.600
What is this?

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:45.310
It is called “Chaff”.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.000
Do not dismiss them as mere pieces of aluminum foil.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:54.010
They disturb signals around them, causing a form of jamming.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:09:00.020
Did you think I dropped you merely as a feint attack?

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:04.100
This building is thirty floors tall, and in another sense, a giant box.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:13.130
This “box” is filled with signal disturbance substances and jamming devices.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:17.260
Not a single signal will escape from this place.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.990
Hysterica, that includes your phone.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:25.120
Begin the hunt, my knights.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.200
Toranomon, all clear.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.130
Otemachi, all clear.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.280
Exterminate them!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:41.010
If you fail to get them all, we lose.

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.430
It is your loss, Hysterica.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:50.270
I will also mention that all the doors are heavily locked.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.480
The only way out is…

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:57.680
You’re not going anywhere, Hysterica!

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:02.140
Can you hear me, Piglet?

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.730
You aren’t dead yet, are you?

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.850
Go to the rooftop!

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.030
Send out the command with your cellphone!

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.770
Didn’t I promise you, Piglet?

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.540
Once this is over, I’ll free you.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.090
You can spend time with that boy.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.640
Yuzuru-chan…

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:26.830
Yuzuru…

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.250
Nanami, wait!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:42.990
No matter how much disturbance there is, they can still send themselves the code.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:49.980
If they blow up at point blank range,
I doubt even you would come out unscathed.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:54.190
Try to move, and I’ll blow you to the moon.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:56.360
I only need your body, anyway.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.090
It’ll be much more convenient to carry around.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.740
Your Highness!

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.480
You will be facing me…

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.080
…Veratos!

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.080
I’m not like how I was back then.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.860
And I’ll make you realize it!

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.820
This is Team Alpha!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.320
Two targets have run off.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.380
Target B, eliminated.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.210
How’s the other one?

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:31.450
In pursuit!

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.080
Wait!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.290
Hiko?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.290
Akira, do it!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.750
Wait, Hiko!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.260
Wait!

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.460
Yuzuru…

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.220
Yuzuru-chan…

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.390
Onee-chan.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.270
Yuzuru-chan?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.140
Yuzuru…

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.440
Yuzuru-chan!

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.210
Come.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.140
Come with me.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.510
Listen, Yuzuru.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.450
You are the last line of defense.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:08.690
The ruling of a master is rather strong.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:10.490
It is impossible to go against their orders.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:16.000
But it is also difficult for vampires to resist their obsessions.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.130
What do you believe is Nanami’s obsession?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:21.880
Me?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.390
Yes.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:26.060
The stronger her obsession towards you is,

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:32.060
the stronger the force that pulls her back to us will be.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.850
While she is wavering between her order and her instinct…

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.020
That is when we will attack.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.360
Onee-chan, come with me.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.490
Come!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.010
What are you hesitating for?

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:49.160
Hurry up and go!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.290
You can’t, Onee-chan!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:52.860
Look at me!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.410
I know you want me!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.410
I’ll become yours!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.670
So come!

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.600
Onee-chan…

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.440
I’m sorry.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.690
Hiko!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.150
Hiko! Hiko!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.830
Everyone, head to the rear subway cart!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.680
Kaburagi-kun…

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.480
Hiko, you’re pretty quick on your feet.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.780
I had to get serious for a second.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.510
It’s all right now, so don’t worry.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:03.090
I won’t do anything to you, so come here.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:03.570
Okay?

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.390
I can’t…

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.060
It’s already too late.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.900
I was totally clueless.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.460
Nothing…

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.910
Nothing changed at all.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.780
Hiko?

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:19.440
The weak remain weak, still stepped upon by the strong,

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.120
and then disposed of.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:24.770
I can’t endure this for an eternity.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:25.920
I’m at my limits.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.780
Don’t just decide things, Hiko!

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:30.200
You’ve got so many ways to live!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.280
I’m here.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.180
I’ll find it with you.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.040
I should’ve…

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.540
…talked with you more.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:38.430
Then I’m sure that…

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:40.170
It’s not too late!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.440
It definitely isn’t, Hiko!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.310
Thank you, Akira-kun.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.400
Don’t do it!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.830
An eternity…

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:04.210
An eternity is like the flow of an endless river.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:08.920
Without something to hold on to, you’ll be pulled under…

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.520
Curses!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:25.850
Vera!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.230
Vera!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:41.910
My, my…

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:44.700
What an end.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:47.420
Though, I guess it fits her.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:50.580
She was killed by the boy she loved.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:51.920
I guess dreams can come true.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.180
Don’t cry, Piglet.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.680
He’ll join you soon enough.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:02.020
You won’t die a peaceful death, boy.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.060
You…

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.810
Who the…

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.870
It can’t be… Princess Mina?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.440
I see!

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.220
That’s your true form!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.220
This is great.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.460
I wonder what the Three Clans would say.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.170
It’s going to get ugly, you know?

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.920
Do you think I’d leave anyone who sees me like this alive?

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.420
Then… how about this?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:38.680
Look at that!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.680
Your precious kids are falling.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.920
Not bad.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:57.030
You not only saved the boy, but even that girl’s corpse.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.160
You’re so kind, Your Highness.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.290
Idiotically kind.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.100
Do you understand?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:07.540
If I send out the detonation signal, you’re going to blow up along with her.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.000
It’s not too late, you know?

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.190
And it’s very simple.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.960
You just need to let them die and come kill me.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.470
Can you do it?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.800
Of course you can’t.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:20.870
I knew it.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.560
You disappoint me.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:26.180
You really aren’t fit to be our Queen.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.060
Not the Queen of the New World!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.560
So you really are from Telomere.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:33.070
I win, Princess.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.780
Spend the rest of your lives as slaves of the Three Clans.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.710
I’ll tell you something nice.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.720
Princess Mina’s crucial secret.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.450
Hi, Hysterica.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.290
What are you so excited about?

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.410
Why the hell are you…

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.150
You’re… alive?

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:54.090
How…

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.510
How dare you…

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.340
…attack your Master.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.090
You’re no longer her master.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:04.990
That stake was hollow, just like this building.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:10.110
It was filled with a culture fluid containing DNA I extracted from my body.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.480
Overwritten…

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.590
I stole her from you.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.190
Nanami is my servant now.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:24.470
Hysterica, you should have blown me up without a thought.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.960
But you did something else first.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.330
It was because of your own ego.

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.660
I win.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.720
I told you that I’m your opponent, Francesca!

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:43.260
Liar…

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.220
You said…

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.760
…we’d be together forever.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.390
Fran…

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.390
Princess…

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.250
Vera…

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:01.290
I was the one who turned Francesca into a vampire.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:05.410
She lost her family to the Spanish Flu, and I couldn’t leave her alone to die.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.750
It is all in the past.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.910
All of it.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.840
Nanami.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.290
Will you come with me?

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.790
Yes. Your wish is my command.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:19.760
If you enter the Bund, you will be unable to see Yuzuru anymore.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.550
Could you endure it?

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:25.230
Vera-san.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:25.850
Yes?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:28.730
Have you ever regretted becoming a vampire?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.140
I have not.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.390
Not once.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.110
Princess!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.150
Akira, are you all right?

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.300
Where’s the President?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.120
An eternity…

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:58.830
An eternity is like the flow of an endless river.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:03.350
Without something to hold on to, you’ll be pulled under.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.720
I see.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.010
You managed to save her.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.520
I wasn’t able…

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.640
…to save him.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.230
Become strong, Akira.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.280
But I do not mean at this moment.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.690
Take your time.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.490
As much as you need.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.540
It appears like something happened in Tokyo.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.860
Yes.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:38.500
She founded a district in a small corner of Asia,

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.000
but it is meaningless if she cannot control it.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.760
In the end, she’s merely playing war with a toy castle.

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.350
My colleagues.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:52.610
It is somewhat early, but shall we go greet her?

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.430
Our fiancée, I mean.

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:41.440
Akira, a wolf boy, encounters a fateful reunion on his seventeenth birthday.

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:43.190
You’re…

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.510
It has been a long time, Akira.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:47.200
I don’t… know you.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.240
Liar.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.580
You could not possibly forget my fingers.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.700
Hey, stop.

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:54.970
An irresistibly strong stream of passion…

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:58.390
The requiem for the boys who fall deeply into the depths of love.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:01.450
A forbidden story of youth told by Saegusa Yuki…

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:02.940
…<i>Rose and Wolf !</i>

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:03.880
Coming soon!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:04.530
That kind of book won’t be coming out!
Coming soon!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.080
I want to read it!
That kind of book won’t be coming out!

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:06.450
That kind of book won’t be coming out!
